  "details": "An option to link and select all cameras, then adjust the settings for(or move) all of them at once. The main use case being when you import a dolly .json and you need to make adjustments to height or location\n\nCurrently; for example, if you need to change the height of the entire imported path you have to do each camera manually. This is often an impossible task to keep everything nice and equal, and once things get messy it is better to do it all from scratch making it useless to have even imported the path originally. Which is a shame.",
